# College Finder / BranchIntel
#
# Production static sites (e.g. collegemap.in) cannot serve /api. Never set the URL below
# to the static site hostname — only the Node/Express API origin. If mis-set, College Finder
# breaks while hardcoded APIs used to mask the mistake.
#
# The app defaults to the same Express URL as seminar/profile APIs unless you override:
#
# REACT_APP_COLLEGEMAP_API_URL=https://collegemapseminarpage.vercel.app
# REACT_APP_BRANCHINTEL_API_URL=https://your-express-host.example.com
#
# Backend (Vercel/Heroku) must run latest Backend/server.js + GEMINI_API_KEY in env.

# Recommended for this project (same as committed .env.production):
REACT_APP_COLLEGEMAP_API_URL=https://collegemapseminarpage.vercel.app
REACT_APP_BRANCHINTEL_API_URL=
